flowchart TD
    FAIL[background work unreliable] --> WHY{why?}
    WHY -->|deferred by Doze/bucket| ACCEPT[expected - make idempotent + catch-up; use FCM for urgent]
    WHY -->|killed by OEM| GUIDE[guide user to exempt; FGS for critical]
    WHY -->|wrong mechanism| ROUTE[WorkManager/FGS/FCM/alarm per need]
    WHY -->|battery flagged| COOPERATE[drop wakelocks/exact alarms; set constraints]
